{"3605230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fire Burning City", "steam_appid": 3605230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Demo Out! Try it, wishlist it!<br>Discord:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >————————</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world connected by cyberbrains, a digital virus turns everyone into savage thugs. As the sole unconnected agent — the &quot;Outsider&quot; — you must fight through the burning cities to end the global crisis.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Burning City</strong> blends turn-based tactical grid combat with   Survivor-Like gameplay. Move on a grid, unleash skills, and enjoy wiping out hordes with simple strategy. Survive and take down powerful bosses to clear each stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Unique Combat: Turn-Based Grid + Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike conventional Survivor-Likes, no exhausting real-time micromanagement or complex strategy. Simple controls for more relaxed, exhilarating action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/d5e04f2d7793d4dea56e783be8c10c39.poster.avif?t=1787411462\" width=626 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/d5e04f2d7793d4dea56e783be8c10c39.webm?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/d5e04f2d7793d4dea56e783be8c10c39.mp4?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>A Wealth of Super Flashy Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing beats the satisfaction of mowing down enemies with visually stunning skills — you’ll know when you try it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/1ed51504e8347e143a06c042e8862980.poster.avif?t=1787411462\" width=626 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/1ed51504e8347e143a06c042e8862980.webm?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/1ed51504e8347e143a06c042e8862980.mp4?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Attribute Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your combat power with hundreds of attributes. Every run is a fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/cbfcb1c2e4a3b47a4e6fe41ac8fee5dd.poster.avif?t=1787411462\" width=626 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/cbfcb1c2e4a3b47a4e6fe41ac8fee5dd.webm?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/cbfcb1c2e4a3b47a4e6fe41ac8fee5dd.mp4?t=1787411462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Role Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different role traits unightlock entirely different build directions and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605230/extras/f204b887cbc350b7db1f0167d0ed6610.poster.avif?t=1787411462\" width=626 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass